      "id": "source-58",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:19:37Z",
      "note": "Arbitrum receipts and callTracer checked 2026-09-13. Full-history Round Open/Redeem topic searches (0x5a3815aac78c63e8e8e94e1bf2d7294adb131f4320dc4172da5d7594eb7bb089 / 0x8e13eae94523af1c4e18788b451cbcf1a6bc9c1ad9f96c3bf1601670e3455988) return 183 opens and 182 redeems, starting at block 463840942 index 1. Sixteen receipts contain 182 atomic redemptions; 37 additional receipts dispose of SEA. The seed anchor was the twelfth successful campaign transaction. Three subsequent attempts by 0x352173fabf0e67e1cb1fcdf15474d0477d5d3674 have successful outer receipts but no logs; trace of 0x6e990ac3eaf9abe44a2ff694161b36d62be0f86aed8050b05838ae79bd6d039f shows caught Insufficient ecosystem pool reversion. Earlier wrapper calls 0x815c79ef4eb0dfe8b96789abd9fb2efb8147159459e21a2bfef09d5c74075590 and 0x980840f4be6bb16eb8e8afa8720f3e0a9a61bf7a9e97f245d833754cff04d9e2 trace unrelated WETH operations and caught reverts, not this SEA fault."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-59",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:19:37Z",
      "note": "Net every USDT Transfer in the 53 cited campaign/disposal receipts: pair 0xeeb9c6b73a9ba397fbea320d9e4cce7b8ac10513 loses 213944.898898 USDT. Recipient gains reconcile exactly: 17993.689894, 60086.474036, 81130.869132, 42413.245365 and 12277.660891 USDT, plus financing recipients 23.1 and 19.859580 USDT. Flash principals and identifiable campaign inputs net out; financing costs remain in gross loss. SEA bought/deposited, tax routing, and sales are not valued a second time. The bot 0x4ac7e9f0e5b3313e06bd9337c5311674e70220ba retains 383317.208218 SEA: complete receipt netting matches balanceOf at block 463841333, versus zero at 463840941. This residual is unvalued, making the realised cash measurement a lower bound, not a concrete full USD loss."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-60",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:19:37Z",
      "note": "The first exploit callTracer reaches Round proxy 0xa70f31c06f921019237fc00b1417217dae5c37c5 and DELEGATECALLs 0x13dde273b66323686bfb96cce5a2a7190b40b264; redemption calls distributor 0x5210525fbf63e55eca1ade9ff98a3ef80af9220e through implementation 0xd4114ed07febc57113158d53266f6ecb71447fbf. Both implementation sources are unverified. Full-history Upgraded searches return 21 Round and 4 distributor activations. The latest Round upgrade is block 463777597, but a later admin call at block 463777611 changes Round slot 5 from 0x000000000000000000000000dd1f86e76c3e57fa836d68cc0d7d81184269543b to 0x000000000000000000000000eeb9c6b73a9ba397fbea320d9e4cce7b8ac10513, reproduced with prestateTracer diffMode. The causal significance of this pair change, other critical configuration, and the distributor artifact must be established before final age or target promotion."
    }
